OL,3,A'We're not going to bend': Canada
OL,4,Aannounces $20bn of retaliatory tariffs
OL,5,Aon US goods
OL,6,
OL,7,FCanada announces $20bn of retaliatory
OL,8,Ftariffs on US goods as a trade war
OL,9,Fbetween the two countries escalates -
OL,10,Fhere's what we know
OL,12,FMeasures beyond counter-tariffs to
OL,13,F"protect and support Canadian workers
OL,14,Fand businesses" are also being rolled
OL,15,Fout
OL,17,F"We're not going to bend, we're not
OL,18,Fgoing to break, we're going to build,"
OL,19,Fsays Evan Solomon, minister for AI and
OL,20,Fdigital innovation
