OL,3,A'We're not going to bend': Canada
OL,4,Aannounces $20bn of retaliatory tariffs
OL,5,Aon US goods
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US announced a 50% tariff on a
OL,8,Frange of Canadian goods after trade
OL,9,Ftalks collapsed at the weekend and US
OL,10,FPresident Donald Trump further
OL,11,Fthreatened to hike tariffs on Canadian
OL,12,Fvehicles to 50% from 1 January
OL,14,FCanadian Prime Minister Mark Carney
OL,15,Faccused Trump of trying to "destroy"
OL,16,Fthe country's auto industry - their
OL,17,Frelationship has deteriorated
OL,18,Fsignificantly
